d}_T(\\varnothing)","display":false}],"bytes":2792,"backlinks":[{"id":"5698dbb792dca9ba","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]。$\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]$、$E_\\eta$ 在下式构造；$\\eta(\\bar k)$ 为对指定变量 $x$ 的无捕获数词代入。"},{"id":"5b6e0fc96331c897","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_T$、$\\mathrm{Irred}_T$ 与 $\\mathrm{REAx}$ 取 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]] 及其已声明接口。"},{"id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_S$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]。$\\bigwedge$ 取 [[67-df-formula]] 的有限列递归，空列的值为 $\\top_{L_A}$。$\\mathrm{Conj}(X)$ 在下式构造。"},{"id":"19405805e97916e7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Pi_n$ 见 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]；$\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；$\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization]]。"},{"id":"fbcaa556e59d96b1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_{\\varnothing}$ 取 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]，$\\varnothing$ 为逻辑的空非逻辑公理集；采用本册固定句法编号和标准证明算术化。"},{"id":"57d3217ac67bc5a6","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{ExistsIrred}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]；$\\mathrm{Num}_T$、$\\mathrm{Indep}_T$ 见 [[67-df-numeration]]、[[67-df-independent-formula]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-uniform-reflection]]；[[../67-